## Naming Conventions

### Folders
```
✅ kebab-case
order-list/
customer-detail/

❌ PascalCase
OrderList/
CustomerDetail/
```

### Files
```
✅ kebab-case with suffix
order-list.component.ts
create-order.use-case.ts
order.repository.interface.ts

❌ PascalCase or no suffix
OrderList.component.ts
CreateOrder.ts
```

### Classes
```
✅ PascalCase
OrderListComponent
CreateOrderUseCase
IOrderRepository

❌ camelCase
orderListComponent
createOrderUseCase
```

